[{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-1609","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-1609.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0803","title":"GNU Groff 本地特权提升漏洞","description":"GNU Groff 排版系统存在提权漏洞。Groff 在查找设备描述文件时使用当前工作目录，攻击者可在本地放置伪造的 postpro 指令描述文件。当其他用户在该目录运行 groff 时，恶意指令会被执行，导致权限提升。CVSS 评分为 10 分（AV:N/AC:L/Au:N/C:C/I:C/A:C），危害严重。攻击者无需网络访问，仅需本地路径可写权限，诱导目标用户在恶意文件所在目录执行 groff 即可触发。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":10.0,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0803"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-12-19T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:52:30Z","remediation":"<value>升级 GNU Groff 至 1.17 或更高版本。在 Debian/Ubuntu 系统中执行 `apt-get update && apt-get install groff`；在 RHEL/CentOS 系统中执行 `yum update groff` 或 `dnf update groff`。如无法立即升级，可采取以下缓解措施：（1）从受信任的目录运行 groff，避免在可写目录下执行；（2）检查是否存在恶意设备描述文件（如 postpro 等）并删除；（3）通过 `chmod 700` 限制用户工作目录权限，防止本地用户放置恶意描述文件；（4）定期审查 groff 运行目录下的异常文件。</arg_value></tool_call>","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-02T00:00:00Z","references":["https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/5280","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/e6aabfe8f44c300141dcaef9d34124defc87c0a5/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0803.json","https://github.com/open-edge-platform/edge-microvisor-toolkit/blob/6b93a174634cc0755a555ba6e9fd5dd4026076e8/SPECS/groff/CVE-2000-0803.nopatch","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/b89c1361e80164e63267f0c56728f3ef6b54b865/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0803.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0803","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-0803.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/9b1777f43cb72006ac01427b6823146d45a3862a/nvdcve/CVE-2000-0803.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/99a2d0f359c44d8b27ea5e35eaa72ec2eb0f3016/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-08xx/CVE-2000-0803.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/399bcc30c25c09ed012c9f952b7942b4002015c0/2000/CVE-2000-0803.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/aa26e43cea95c9f8fa4c03fce1cced7c702a4035/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0803.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelist-dev/blob/5b8fbb570438e8094550205589cc6f1d122acc94/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0803.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2000/POC-AVE-2000-1609.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-1609.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-1040","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-1040.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0997","title":"OpenBSD NetBSD eeprom 格式字符串本地提权漏洞","description":"BSD 系列操作系统（包括 OpenBSD、NetBSD 以及其他可能受影响的类 BSD 系统）的 eeprom 程序中存在格式字符串漏洞。由于程序在处理用户输入时未对格式化字符串进行充分校验，本地攻击者可通过构造包含特殊格式说明符（如 %x、%n 等）的输入触发该漏洞，进而篡改内存数据并实现权限提升，最终获得目标系统的 root 权限。该漏洞影响本地登录用户或拥有 shell 访问权限的攻击者，利用门槛较低，且成功利用后可完全控制受影响系统，对系统机密性、完整性和可用性造成严重危害。OpenBSD 已发布 028_format_strings.patch 补丁修复此问题。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.2,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0997"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-12-19T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:52:56Z","remediation":"OpenBSD 2.7 用户应立即下载并应用官方补丁 028_format_strings.patch（ftp://ftp.openbsd.org/pub/OpenBSD/patches/2.7/common/028_format_strings.patch），进入 /usr/src 目录后执行 patch -p0 < 028_format_strings.patch，随后依次重新编译并安装受影响的 eeprom（仅 sparc 平台）、fstat、passwd、su、top、ssh 程序。NetBSD 及其他 BSD 衍生版用户应升级至内核源码树已合并该修复的稳定版本，或联系厂商获取对应补丁。如无法立即打补丁，应通过文件系统权限或防火墙规则限制本地非特权用户对 eeprom 及相关系统程序的访问，以降低本地提权风险。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-05T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1752","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/5337","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/cbc8909f965784fa84e604f999ad78ba1a862d6c/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0997.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0997","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/d9d0e44f54f90ad1b4ec106b1cac94be29b99757/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0997.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-0997.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/2aff155da1d1b98876d6e9c312b912d434f32dca/nvdcve/CVE-2000-0997.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/9854c179c024bf1d349f724d8589444858e69aa7/2000/CVE-2000-0997.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/8e09cd003036511dff025515f28920f1d343007b/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0997.md","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/2045bff4b424e5738e99702781803fdc8b55ff87/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-09xx/CVE-2000-0997.json","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0997.json","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelist-dev/blob/5b8fbb570438e8094550205589cc6f1d122acc94/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0997.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-1040.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-1039","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-1039.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0996","title":"OpenBSD su 程序格式字符串漏洞","description":"OpenBSD su程序存在格式字符串漏洞，本地攻击者可通过向su程序传入包含格式化占位符特制参数的恶意shell命令触发该漏洞，进而获取root权限。该漏洞影响OpenBSD及可能其他基于BSD的操作系统，成功利用后可完全控制系统。攻击者需具备本地登录权限，通过精心构造包含格式字符串的shell参数，利用程序未正确过滤用户输入中的格式化字符（如%x、%n等）的缺陷，读取或覆盖任意内存内容，最终实现本地权限提升至root。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.2,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0996"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-12-19T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:52:56Z","remediation":"立即应用 OpenBSD 官方安全补丁 028_format_strings.patch（ftp://ftp.openbsd.org/pub/OpenBSD/patches/2.7/common/028_format_strings.patch），进入 /usr/src 目录执行 patch -p0 < 028_format_strings.patch，随后重新编译并安装 libutil 及 su 程序；临时缓解措施可执行 chmod u-s /usr/bin/su 移除 setuid 位以阻断本地提权路径；长期建议升级至 OpenBSD 2.8 或更高版本。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-05T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.osvdb.org/6124","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/5636","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/cbc8909f965784fa84e604f999ad78ba1a862d6c/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0996.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/d9d0e44f54f90ad1b4ec106b1cac94be29b99757/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0996.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0996","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-0996.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/2aff155da1d1b98876d6e9c312b912d434f32dca/nvdcve/CVE-2000-0996.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/2045bff4b424e5738e99702781803fdc8b55ff87/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-09xx/CVE-2000-0996.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/c9ca0c7ecb65f7366b1a83938dcd1c80cf9c2d0e/2000/CVE-2000-0996.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/8e09cd003036511dff025515f28920f1d343007b/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0996.md","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0996.json","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelist-dev/blob/5b8fbb570438e8094550205589cc6f1d122acc94/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0996.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-1039.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-1038","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-1038.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0995","title":"OpenBSD yp_passwd 格式字符串漏洞","description":"OpenBSD yp_passwd 程序存在格式字符串漏洞，未经身份认证的本地攻击者可通过向该程序传入包含格式字符串特制名称参数来利用此漏洞，导致在受影响系统上以 root 权限执行任意代码。该漏洞影响 OpenBSD 2.7 及其他基于 BSD 的操作系统，CVSS 评分 7.2，危害等级高。OpenBSD 已于 2000 年 10 月发布安全补丁 028_format_strings.patch 修复此问题。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.2,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0995"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-12-19T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:52:56Z","remediation":"建议升级至 OpenBSD 2.7 并应用补丁 patch 028（ftp://ftp.openbsd.org/pub/OpenBSD/patches/2.7/common/028_format_strings.patch），或直接升级至 OpenBSD 2.8 及后续版本，该补丁将 yp_passwd.c 中第 75 行的 warn(name) 修正为 warn(\"%s\", name) 以消除格式字符串漏洞。如短期内无法打补丁，可临时执行 chmod u-s /usr/bin/yp_passwd 移除 setuid 位，阻断本地提权路径；若系统不使用 NIS/YP 服务，建议直接停用或卸载 ypbind 及相关 NIS 客户端服务，从根源消除攻击面。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-05T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.osvdb.org/6125","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/5635","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/cbc8909f965784fa84e604f999ad78ba1a862d6c/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0995.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/d9d0e44f54f90ad1b4ec106b1cac94be29b99757/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0995.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0995","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-0995.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/2aff155da1d1b98876d6e9c312b912d434f32dca/nvdcve/CVE-2000-0995.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/2045bff4b424e5738e99702781803fdc8b55ff87/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-09xx/CVE-2000-0995.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/bd65d87495327c522ef03e0100b7141c41565410/2000/CVE-2000-0995.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/8e09cd003036511dff025515f28920f1d343007b/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0995.md","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0995.json","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelist-dev/blob/5b8fbb570438e8094550205589cc6f1d122acc94/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0995.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-1038.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-1037","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-1037.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0990","title":"Krzysztof Dabrowski cmd5checkpw SMTP AUTH 命令拒绝服务漏洞","description":"cmd5checkpw 0.21 及更早版本中存在拒绝服务漏洞，远程攻击者可通过向 SMTP 服务发送包含未知用户名的 \"SMTP AUTH\" 命令，导致服务进程崩溃或资源耗尽，造成拒绝服务。攻击无需身份认证，攻击复杂度低，影响服务的可用性。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0990"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-12-19T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:52:55Z","remediation":"建议升级 cmd5checkpw 至 0.22 或更高版本（若存在）；该软件已停止维护，建议迁移至其他维护中的 SMTP 认证方案（如 Dovecot SASL）。临时缓解措施：在 SMTP 服务端配置中禁用 AUTH 命令或限制未知用户名请求的速率。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-05T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2000-10/0258.html","http://members.elysium.pl/brush/cmd5checkpw/changes.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1809","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/5382","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/86965a1ef7a64a35a4bffc5193446981deb1b2f5/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0990.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/d9d0e44f54f90ad1b4ec106b1cac94be29b99757/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0990.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0990","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-0990.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/2aff155da1d1b98876d6e9c312b912d434f32dca/nvdcve/CVE-2000-0990.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/24bf8ab9ac19d70e8e7ca347101f59bbc2694f11/2000/CVE-2000-0990.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/2045bff4b424e5738e99702781803fdc8b55ff87/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-09xx/CVE-2000-0990.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/e2cba2a029d0a53c95f0000f5eb42e0eb69717b8/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0990.md","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0990.json","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelist-dev/blob/5b8fbb570438e8094550205589cc6f1d122acc94/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0990.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-1037.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-1036","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-1036.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0988","title":"Bardon Data Systems WinU 后门密码漏洞","description":"Bardon Data Systems WinU 1.0 至 5.1 版本存在硬编码后门密码漏洞。攻击者可通过该预设密码绕过身份认证，远程登录管理界面并修改系统配置，包括用户权限、网络设置等关键参数。该漏洞利用难度较低，只需知道默认后门密码即可实施攻击，可能导致系统被完全控制。厂商未提供官方补丁，建议升级或停止使用受影响版本。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.2,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0988"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-12-19T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:52:55Z","remediation":"厂商 Bardon Data Systems 已在其官方网站（http://www.bardon.com/pwdcrack.htm）公布后门密码详情。建议用户立即停止使用 WinU 1.0 至 5.1 版本，升级至已移除后门密码的修复版本。如厂商未提供修复版本，应迁移至其他安全的远程管理替代工具。无法立即升级时，应在防火墙层面严格限制对 WinU 管理端口的网络访问，仅允许受信 IP 连接。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-05T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2000-10/0238.html","http://www.bardon.com/pwdcrack.htm","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1801","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/5376","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/86965a1ef7a64a35a4bffc5193446981deb1b2f5/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0988.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/f80eaead111eac7128eaf77e46b372cdbd675cc9/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0988.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0988","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-0988.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/2aff155da1d1b98876d6e9c312b912d434f32dca/nvdcve/CVE-2000-0988.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/aea030fdb9f850918f67ec4845c1a97cd9f61f7a/2000/CVE-2000-0988.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/2045bff4b424e5738e99702781803fdc8b55ff87/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-09xx/CVE-2000-0988.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/e2cba2a029d0a53c95f0000f5eb42e0eb69717b8/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0988.md","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0988.json","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelist-dev/blob/5b8fbb570438e8094550205589cc6f1d122acc94/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0988.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-1036.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-1035","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-1035.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0986","title":"Oracle 8.1.5 缓冲区溢出权限提升漏洞","description":"Oracle 8.1.5（Oracle 8i）中的多个应用程序组件（包括 names、namesctl、onrsd、osslogin、tnslsnr、tnsping、trcasst、trcroute）存在缓冲区溢出漏洞。本地攻击者可通过向 ORACLE_HOME 环境变量传递超长字符串触发缓冲区溢出，成功利用后可获取目标系统的提升权限，导致机密性、完整性和可用性部分受损。该漏洞需要本地访问权限，攻击复杂度较低。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":4.6,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0986"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-12-19T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:52:54Z","remediation":"立即升级 Oracle 数据库至受支持的版本（如 19c 或更高版本），Oracle 8.1.5 已停止技术支持多年，不再提供安全补丁。如无法升级，作为临时缓解措施，限制本地用户对 Oracle 相关二进制文件（names、tnslsnr 等）的执行权限，并通过系统级环境变量白名单机制防止 ORACLE_HOME 被传入超长字符串。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-05T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2000-10/0294.html","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/5390","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/7db8931ea0378982e66f435e269a4ed0e4efb7aa/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0986.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/f80eaead111eac7128eaf77e46b372cdbd675cc9/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0986.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0986","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-0986.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/2aff155da1d1b98876d6e9c312b912d434f32dca/nvdcve/CVE-2000-0986.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/2045bff4b424e5738e99702781803fdc8b55ff87/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-09xx/CVE-2000-0986.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/aea030fdb9f850918f67ec4845c1a97cd9f61f7a/2000/CVE-2000-0986.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/e2cba2a029d0a53c95f0000f5eb42e0eb69717b8/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0986.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelist-dev/blob/5b8fbb570438e8094550205589cc6f1d122acc94/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0986.json","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0986.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-1035.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-1034","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-1034.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0981","title":"MySQL 数据库引擎 弱认证信息泄露漏洞","description":"MySQL 数据库引擎使用了一种弱身份认证方法，该方法在认证过程中会泄露密码哈希信息，远程攻击者无需身份认证即可通过网络嗅探或中间人攻击捕获认证数据包，进而通过离线暴力破解或字典攻击恢复明文密码。该漏洞影响 MySQL 3.23.x 及更早版本，攻击者获得密码后可完全控制数据库系统，造成数据泄露、篡改或破坏。利用该漏洞无需特殊权限，仅需能够监听目标 MySQL 服务与客户端之间的网络通信即可实施攻击。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.2,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0981"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-12-19T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:52:54Z","remediation":"升级 MySQL 至 4.1.0 及以上版本，新版本使用更安全的 41 位哈希认证协议替代旧版弱认证。如无法升级，在 my.cnf 中设置 old_passwords=0 禁用旧密码格式，并将所有用户密码重新设置为新格式哈希。同时限制数据库服务仅对可信 IP 开放。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-05T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2000-10/0318.html","http://www.mysql.com/documentation/mysql/commented/manual.php?section=Security","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/5409","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/7db8931ea0378982e66f435e269a4ed0e4efb7aa/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0981.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/f80eaead111eac7128eaf77e46b372cdbd675cc9/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0981.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0981","https://github.com/mysql/mysql-server/blob/06a5c1c99c377fc41b2eba1ea244e8b220bdc3c8/sql/auth/sql_authentication.cc","https://github.com/alibaba/AliSQL/blob/9e121f27d404cad6cdb1cc695eab4276469adace/sql/auth/sql_authentication.cc","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-0981.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/2aff155da1d1b98876d6e9c312b912d434f32dca/nvdcve/CVE-2000-0981.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/fc250cf8fdc59c77fa474d34589422db608209f4/2000/CVE-2000-0981.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/2045bff4b424e5738e99702781803fdc8b55ff87/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-09xx/CVE-2000-0981.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/e2cba2a029d0a53c95f0000f5eb42e0eb69717b8/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0981.md"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-1034.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-1033","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-1033.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0980","title":"Microsoft NWLink NMPI监听器广播风暴漏洞","description":"Microsoft NWLink 协议栈中的 NMPI（IPX 名称管理协议）监听器存在数据包过滤缺陷，未能正确过滤来自广播地址的数据包。远程攻击者无需身份认证即可向目标系统发送特制的 IPX 广播数据包，触发广播风暴，导致网络带宽被大量无效流量耗尽，造成拒绝服务。该漏洞影响 Microsoft Windows 系列系统中启用了 NWLink IPX/SPX 协议组件的版本，CVSS 评分 5.0，危害等级中等。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0980"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-12-19T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:52:54Z","remediation":"建议立即禁用 NWLink IPX/SPX 协议（若业务不需要），通过控制面板 → 网络连接 → 属性 → 卸载 \"NWLink IPX/SPX/NetBIOS Compatible Transport Protocol\" 组件。若必须使用 NWLink，则安装 Microsoft 2000 年 12 月发布的安全更新（MS00-097），并在路由器/防火墙上过滤 IPX 广播包（目标地址 FF:FF:FF:FF:FF:FF），限制 NMPI 监听端口 137-138 的广播流量。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-05T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1781","https://docs.microsoft.com/en-us/security-updates/securitybulletins/2000/ms00-073","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/5357","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/94290d9b87aa464f4465c4bb2b955170c77f08c2/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0980.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/5d8a0e95a20fbbbf3a45b439096d57770d841dec/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0980.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0980","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-0980.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/2aff155da1d1b98876d6e9c312b912d434f32dca/nvdcve/CVE-2000-0980.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/fc250cf8fdc59c77fa474d34589422db608209f4/2000/CVE-2000-0980.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/e2cba2a029d0a53c95f0000f5eb42e0eb69717b8/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0980.md","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/2045bff4b424e5738e99702781803fdc8b55ff87/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-09xx/CVE-2000-0980.json","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0980.json","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelist-dev/blob/5b8fbb570438e8094550205589cc6f1d122acc94/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0980.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-1033.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-1032","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-1032.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0978","title":"Big Brother System and Network Monitor bbd服务器 远程命令执行漏洞","description":"Big Brother System and Network Monitor 的 bbd 服务器组件存在命令注入漏洞，由于未对用户输入中的 shell 元字符进行过滤，远程攻击者可通过向目标服务器的 bbd 服务发送包含 \"&\" 等 shell 元字符的特制请求，在服务器上以 bbd 进程权限执行任意系统命令。该漏洞影响 Big Brother System and Network Monitor 1.5c2 之前的所有版本，CVSS 评分 7.5，危害等级高。攻击者无需身份认证即可远程利用，可能导致服务器被完全控制、数据泄露或进一步横向移动。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0978"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-12-19T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:52:53Z","remediation":"升级 Big Brother System and Network Monitor 至 1.5c2 或更高版本，该版本修复了 bbd 服务器对 shell 元字符（&）的过滤缺陷。如无法升级，在 bbd 服务器前端部署反向代理或 WAF，对传入请求中的 shell 元字符进行过滤拦截，或禁用 bbd 服务的网络暴露端口。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-05T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2000-10/0162.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1779","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/5719","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/94290d9b87aa464f4465c4bb2b955170c77f08c2/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0978.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/5d8a0e95a20fbbbf3a45b439096d57770d841dec/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0978.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0978","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-0978.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/2aff155da1d1b98876d6e9c312b912d434f32dca/nvdcve/CVE-2000-0978.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/2045bff4b424e5738e99702781803fdc8b55ff87/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-09xx/CVE-2000-0978.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/e9abd745a1d6114f0fa7d3f67607c023bdf3fa37/2000/CVE-2000-0978.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/e2cba2a029d0a53c95f0000f5eb42e0eb69717b8/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0978.md","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0978.json","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelist-dev/blob/5b8fbb570438e8094550205589cc6f1d122acc94/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0978.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-1032.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-1031","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-1031.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0966","title":"HP HP-UX lpspooler 缓冲区溢出权限提升漏洞","description":"HP-UX 操作系统中的 lpspooler 组件（属于 PrinterMgmt.LP-SPOOL 文件集）存在缓冲区溢出漏洞。本地攻击者可利用该漏洞向 lpspooler 发送特制的输入数据触发缓冲区溢出，从而获取目标系统的提升权限。该漏洞影响 HP-UX 11.0 及更早版本，CVSS 评分 4.6，攻击者需拥有本地系统访问权限方可利用，无需用户交互即可完成提权操作。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":4.6,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0966"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-12-19T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:52:52Z","remediation":"立即安装 HP 官方补丁 PHCO_21240（适用于 HP-UX 11.0）或更新版本的对应补丁，修复 lpspooler 中的缓冲区溢出问题。如无法立即打补丁，可临时移除 lpspooler 的 setuid 权限：chmod u-s /usr/bin/lpspooler，并限制本地用户对打印系统的访问权限。同时建议升级到 HP-UX 11.11 或更高版本，该版本已修复此漏洞。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-05T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/hp/2000-q4/0020.html","http://www.osvdb.org/7244","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/5379","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/160b2769d023cca3bba96db1842bf8222b2e286a/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0966.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/2850e862cb7837f03ec4af0066c4f9f10414e805/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0966.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0966","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-0966.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/2aff155da1d1b98876d6e9c312b912d434f32dca/nvdcve/CVE-2000-0966.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/2045bff4b424e5738e99702781803fdc8b55ff87/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-09xx/CVE-2000-0966.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/bd9fe5c6ad63a26e0384af877431750bd67b40cc/2000/CVE-2000-0966.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/c45038e15e6e81771cce5512f28070ebf02ca969/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0966.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelist-dev/blob/5b8fbb570438e8094550205589cc6f1d122acc94/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0966.json","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0966.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-1031.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-1030","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-1030.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0965","title":"HP HP-UX VVOS NSAPI Plugin 拒绝服务漏洞","description":"HP-UX VVOS 10.24 及 11.04 版本中 TGA 和 Java Servlet 代理的 NSAPI 插件存在拒绝服务漏洞。远程攻击者无需身份认证即可通过发送特制请求触发该漏洞，导致目标系统 CPU 资源被大量消耗，造成服务不可用。该漏洞 CVSS 评分 5.0，攻击复杂度低，影响系统可用性，需及时安装厂商补丁修复。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0965"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-12-19T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:52:52Z","remediation":"HP-UX VVOS 10.24 和 11.04 已停止技术支持，建议立即升级至受支持的 HP-UX 11i 版本（如 11.31）并安装最新补丁包。如无法升级，可在 Web 服务器配置中禁用 NSAPI TGA 和 Java Servlet proxy 插件，或在网络边界防火墙阻断对 NSAPI 端口（默认 80/443）的非信任来源访问，以降低 CPU 耗尽型拒绝服务攻击风险。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-05T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/hp/2000-q4/0012.html","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/5361","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/160b2769d023cca3bba96db1842bf8222b2e286a/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0965.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/2850e862cb7837f03ec4af0066c4f9f10414e805/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0965.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0965","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-0965.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/2aff155da1d1b98876d6e9c312b912d434f32dca/nvdcve/CVE-2000-0965.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/2045bff4b424e5738e99702781803fdc8b55ff87/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-09xx/CVE-2000-0965.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/551efeab39fccbe54b7908ab00ab9eb71b9e0872/2000/CVE-2000-0965.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/c45038e15e6e81771cce5512f28070ebf02ca969/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0965.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelist-dev/blob/5b8fbb570438e8094550205589cc6f1d122acc94/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0965.json","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0965.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-1030.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-1029","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-1029.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0962","title":"OpenBSD 2.7 IPsec 空 AH/ESP 数据包拒绝服务漏洞","description":"OpenBSD 2.7 的 IPsec 实现中存在空 AH/ESP 数据包处理缺陷，远程攻击者可通过向目标系统发送特制的空认证头（AH）或封装安全载荷（ESP）数据包触发该漏洞，导致系统内核崩溃或服务中断，造成拒绝服务。该漏洞影响 OpenBSD 2.7 版本，攻击无需身份认证，通过网络即可远程触发，危害等级中等。目前官方已发布补丁修复此问题。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0962"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-12-19T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:52:51Z","remediation":"升级 OpenBSD 至 2.8 或更高版本，该版本已修复空 AH/ESP 报文处理缺陷。如无法升级，在 ipsec.conf 中添加 `block in proto ah` 和 `block in proto esp` 规则临时阻断未认证的 IPsec 流量作为缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-05T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2000-09/0299.html","http://www.osvdb.org/1574","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1723","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/5634","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/160b2769d023cca3bba96db1842bf8222b2e286a/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0962.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/2850e862cb7837f03ec4af0066c4f9f10414e805/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0962.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0962","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-0962.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/2aff155da1d1b98876d6e9c312b912d434f32dca/nvdcve/CVE-2000-0962.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/551efeab39fccbe54b7908ab00ab9eb71b9e0872/2000/CVE-2000-0962.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/2045bff4b424e5738e99702781803fdc8b55ff87/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-09xx/CVE-2000-0962.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/c45038e15e6e81771cce5512f28070ebf02ca969/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0962.md","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0962.json","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelist-dev/blob/5b8fbb570438e8094550205589cc6f1d122acc94/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0962.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-1029.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-1028","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-1028.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0960","title":"Netscape Messaging Server POP3 用户信息枚举漏洞","description":"Netscape Messaging Server 4.15p1 的 POP3 服务器在处理用户认证时存在信息泄露漏洞。当用户输入错误的用户名和错误的密码时，服务器会返回不同的错误提示信息，远程攻击者无需身份认证即可利用该差异枚举系统中的有效用户账户，进而收集有效的电子邮件地址用于垃圾邮件发送。该漏洞利用难度低，攻击者只需通过 POP3 协议发送认证请求即可实施探测，影响运行 Netscape Messaging Server 4.15p1 的系统。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0960"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-12-19T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:52:51Z","remediation":"建议升级到 Netscape Messaging Server 4.15p2 或更高补丁版本，该版本已统一认证失败错误信息，不再区分用户名无效与密码错误。由于该产品已停止维护，长期方案应迁移至受支持的邮件服务器（如 Oracle Communications Messaging Server 或开源方案 Dovecot/Postfix）。如无法立即升级，可在 POP3 端口（110）前部署反向代理，统一返回通用认证失败提示。同时建议在网络层面限制 POP3 服务的访问来源 IP，仅允许可信网段连接。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-05T00:00:00Z","references":["http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=97138100426121&w=2","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1787","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/5364","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/160b2769d023cca3bba96db1842bf8222b2e286a/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0960.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/e6d30197c1ae0e0b416414f6f0ed16544575a73f/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0960.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0960","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-0960.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/2aff155da1d1b98876d6e9c312b912d434f32dca/nvdcve/CVE-2000-0960.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/debb5b9043b725433d6b6e41048f63a9bcce2f7e/2000/CVE-2000-0960.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/2045bff4b424e5738e99702781803fdc8b55ff87/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-09xx/CVE-2000-0960.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/c45038e15e6e81771cce5512f28070ebf02ca969/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0960.md","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0960.json","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelist-dev/blob/5b8fbb570438e8094550205589cc6f1d122acc94/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0960.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-1028.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-1027","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-1027.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0959","title":"GNU glibc LD_DEBUG_OUTPUT 环境变量未清除导致本地符号链接攻击漏洞","description":"glibc2 动态链接器在处理 setuid 程序时未正确清除 LD_DEBUG_OUTPUT 和 LD_DEBUG 环境变量，导致本地攻击者可通过符号链接攻击利用调试输出重定向功能，以提升后的权限覆盖系统任意文件。该漏洞影响使用 glibc2 的 Linux 系统，攻击者需具备本地账户权限并能够触发 setuid 程序的执行，利用难度较高但危害较大，可导致敏感文件被破坏或权限提升。","severity":"LOW","score":1.2,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0959"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-12-19T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:52:51Z","remediation":"立即升级 glibc 至 2.1.94 及以上版本，该版本已修复 setuid 程序执行时 LD_DEBUG_OUTPUT 和 LD_DEBUG 环境变量未正确清除的问题。如无法升级，可在系统级禁用 setuid 二进制文件的 LD_DEBUG 功能，或通过移除 setuid 位限制受影响程序的提权执行。对于关键系统，建议监控 /tmp 目录的符号链接创建行为以检测利用尝试。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-05T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.securityfocus.com/archive/1/85028","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1719","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/5299","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/160b2769d023cca3bba96db1842bf8222b2e286a/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0959.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/e6d30197c1ae0e0b416414f6f0ed16544575a73f/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0959.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee360